  "description": "The embodiment of why we build bike frames from wood. We believe that gravel riding is the perfect discipline to take advantage of wood’s unique natural damping qualities. Forget the complexity of active suspension and let the material do the work.\n\nStrong Smooth Fast Beautiful\n\nUp to 50mm tyre clearance (650b) or 40mm (700c)\n160/160mm rotors\n12mm x 142mm Syntace thru axle\nOptional internal dropper routing\nAvailable as frameset only or complete build\nHand built in Wales using carefully selected British Ash\nSleeved internal cable routing\nStandard bottle mounts on seat tube and down tube\nOptional mounts on top tube and BB\nOptional mud guard and rack mounting points\n700c or 650b wheels\n\nThis build brings you the convenience, reliability and precision of SRAM’s wireless shifting, pairing drop bar controls with MTB gearing. Add world class components from Hope and create a unique example of British craftsmanship.",
